 "timing_note": "Mid-November context: most 2027-start APM/RPM programs (Google, Meta, Uber, Intuit, Salesforce, Atlassian, Microsoft) opened Aug–Oct and have closed or are in interviews. Still open as of this run: Stripe New Grad Accelerator, Databricks APM, Roblox APM 2027, Sierra APX, Perplexity Associate PMM, DoorDash and Flexport rotational programs. Many companies run campus hiring through separate portals (Handshake, company 'students' pages, campus.capitalone.com) that never show up in the main ATS feed this tool reads, so check those links weekly through February. Caveat for a 2025 grad: postings labelled 'New Grad 2027' or '[2027]' are usually for people graduating in 2026–27; roles labelled 'Early Career', 'Associate' or 'Accelerator' (Stripe, Perplexity, Rho, Google Associate BizOps, DoorDash Associate Manager) are the ones that fit someone 1–2 years out."
